{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Tharynn preserves services and accepts the completed Elwynn quest",
  "contract": "The realm-sourced quest text and creature_questender mapping identify NPC 66 as the turn-in for quest 17001. rev_20260923_01_coa_elwynn_quests.sql explicitly sets its QUESTGIVER flag (2), but the later rev_20260930_98_northshire_baseline_restore.sql replaces its template without that flag. Player::CanInteractWithQuestGiver requires flag 2 for reward requests and choices, and PrepareGossipMenu only populates creature quests with that flag. The regression fixtures completed objectives with prepare_quest, then exercises native gossip and actual CMSG_QUESTGIVER_REQUEST_REWARD/CHOOSE_REWARD handlers; it checks the offer packet, rewarded status and consumed delivery items. It does not test objective acquisition, client rendering or original world spawn placement. The existing vendor request remains a control for retained NPC service flags.",
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8914,
    "y": -133,
    "z": 80.6
  },
  "players": [
